{"title":"2026第二季度画作一览","uid":"f6b392990c19142d034054a656d7df0b","slug":"2026第二季度画作一览","date":"2026-08-21T08:50:04.000Z","updated":"2026-09-21T00:11:24.080Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026第二季度画作一览.json","keywords":null,"cover":"/image/t2_4.png","content":"<p>2026第二季度为 阳历 2026 年 6 月 1 日 - 8 月 31 日。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t2_1.png\" alt=\"正邪接力日宣图，于2026.7.22公开\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 60%;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t2_2.png\" alt=\"另外附带文字版本\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 60%;\">\n</div>\n\n<p>正邪接力日宣图，于2026.7.22公开，另外附带文字版本。<br>请大家支持“弹幕逆绘祭”！日后也会继续绘制小碗接力日宣图。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t2_3.png\" alt=\"丽水thp03制品柄图，于2026.8.8公开\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 60%;\">\n</div>\n\n<p>丽水thp03制品柄图，于2026.8.8公开。<br>虽然已经被收录至《梦与光之随笔》，但是为了一致性也收录于该文章。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t2_4.png\" alt=\"淮北火车站的天人组，于2026.8.12公开\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 80%;\">\n</div>\n\n<p>淮北火车站的天人组，于2026.8.12公开<br>这次同样也是永远幻想矩阵的约稿，所以只发布水印版本。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n    <img src=\"/image/t2_5.png\" alt=\"霜月はるか出道20周年贺图，于2026.8.28公开\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 70%;\">\n</div>\n\n<p>霜月はるか出道20周年贺图，于2026.8.28公开<br>应该是第二次画非东方的稿件呢，这个设计也非常华丽~</p>\n<p>其他画作尚未公开，2026第三季度见~</p>\n","text":"2026第二季度为 阳历 2026 年 6 月 1 日 - 8 月 31 日。 正邪接力日宣图，于2026.7.22公开，另外附带文字版本。请大家支持“弹幕逆绘...","permalink":"/post/2026第二季度画作一览","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":315,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"Artwork","slug":"Artwork","count":3,"path":"api/categories/Artwork.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Artwork","slug":"Artwork","count":3,"path":"api/tags/Artwork.json"},{"name":"2026","slug":"2026","count":5,"path":"api/tags/2026.json"},{"name":"summer","slug":"summe